  (text_box "The sleep exit mechanism for C20 need to be verified.\nExit from deep sleep mode is only possible through MFB button trigger.\nSo how to make the device exit from deep sleep using DOCK detect and PB1 \npress need to be figured out.\nwhile dock is connected do we need to go for Deep sleep mode?\nCurrent consumption in Sleep mode and Deep sleep mode to be compared."
    (at 14.986 13.97 0) (size 43.942 10.922)
    (stroke (width 0) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 0.762 0.762)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 6e1592c2-9b2e-4a6a-be68-ad080350d7e9)
  )

  (text "LC Filter for Class-BD amplifier\nEMI/EMC Suppression\n"
    (at 240.792 21.082 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 09b867a5-b35e-4d3a-af15-09d7c4d1b96e)
  )
  (text "MODE PIN usage when using External Clock" (at 19.05 29.21 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.762 0.762)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 304a2466-7931-4185-beb2-90af0f3238ef)
  )
  (text "Caps need to be placed \ncloser to the pins" (at 208.788 21.336 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 49bfa9d6-510a-45ba-9626-7884ddda5c82)
  )
  (text "For higher Audio Output we have\nto push the AVCC voltages to 2.1 V\n"
    (at 42.672 130.429 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 8eb7516d-2474-4037-8b3e-45a13cc5344e)
  )
  (text "Preffered pins for SPI (LED and Push Buttons \npin also can be considered )\n"
    (at 19.304 34.29 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.762 0.762)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid ac7ad899-7efd-4ae1-81fa-9b8e4e3e59d4)
  )
  (text "RFX2401C Recommended Circuit" (at 177.038 156.718 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid ae5c30ec-a6b3-469d-9a59-c0cb73813cc4)
  )
  (text "Can We use DP DN pins for any alternate functions?"
    (at 19.05 30.988 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.762 0.762)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid b026dce0-60c6-45a1-8203-04b4f925eacd)
  )
  (text "Please make sure ADC of the  Battery  monitoring \npart is tuned  for RTL chipset"
    (at 19.304 37.338 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.762 0.762)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid e5935489-19a9-4a49-8e12-3a977e3ac525)
  )
